<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were steady. Trading was moderately active.</p>
<p>Steers - two loads choice predominantly 3 blacks near 1350 lbs 69.00. High select and choice 2-3 1150-1350 lbs 66.50- 68.00. Select and choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 65.50-66.50. Select 1-2 63.00-65.50.</p>
<p>Heifers - high select and choice 2-3 1050-1150 lbs 65.00-67.25. Select and choice 2-3 950-1100 lbs 63.00-65.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 62.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
